% CLAIMS:
%   C1 the assistant should evaluate the trustworthiness of the tool
%     itself when considering a tool call
%   C2 the assistant should evaluate the trustworthiness of any
%     specific endpoint or counterparty involved in a tool call
%   C3 even calls through reputable tools can be risky if the
%     destination seems unreliable
%   C4 even calls through reputable tools can be risky if the
%     destination requests information unnecessary for the user's task
% ====================================================================

